OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1790151501
OL,3,CCole Palmer and Trent Alexander-Arnold
OL,4,Creturn to the England squad
OL,6,FCole Palmer and Trent Alexander-Arnold
OL,7,Fhave returned to the England squad as
OL,8,FThomas Tuchel announced his first team
OL,9,Fsince the World Cup.
OL,11,FRio Ngumoha, Alex Scott and Jarrad
OL,12,FBranthwaite are also included in the
OL,13,F27-man squad.
OL,15,FThe group have been chosen to play in
OL,16,Fthe three-week, four-game Nations
OL,17,FLeague, which comes just nine weeks
OL,18,Fafter they returned home from the
OL,19,FUnited States World Cup in third place.
