OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1790151501
OL,3,CCole Palmer and Trent Alexander-Arnold
OL,4,Creturn to the England squad
OL,6,FAlexander-Arnold and Palmer were the
OL,7,Fstandout inclusions. Alexander-Arnold
OL,8,Fwas included for the first time since
OL,9,FJune 2025 and Palmer returned having
OL,10,Fmissed out on England's World Cup
OL,11,Fsquad.
OL,13,FTeenage winger Ngumoha, who impressed
OL,14,Fon his debut against New Zealand in
OL,15,FJune, and uncapped Scott, are also
OL,16,Fincluded having formed a part of the
OL,17,Fpre-tournament training group in
OL,18,FFlorida.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/8
