OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1790151501
OL,3,CCole Palmer and Trent Alexander-Arnold
OL,4,Creturn to the England squad
OL,6,FBranthwaite, whose only cap came in
OL,7,FJune 2024, received a first call-up
OL,8,Funder Tuchel, with Lewis Hall, Myles
OL,9,FLewis-Skelly and Dominic Calvert-Lewin
OL,10,Falso returning to the squad.
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,17,FPhil Foden, Morgan Gibbs-White and
OL,18,FAdam Wharton were among those
OL,19,Foverlooked for recalls as Tuchel
OL,20,Fdropped World Cup squad members Ollie
OL,21,FWatkins, Ivan Toney and Noni Madueke.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/8
