OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1790151501
OL,3,CCole Palmer and Trent Alexander-Arnold
OL,4,Creturn to the England squad
OL,6,FJohn Stones, Djed Spence, Dan Burn,
OL,7,FJordan Henderson and Dean Henderson
OL,8,Fmissed out through injury.
OL,10,FBrighton's Jason Steele, who worked as
OL,11,Ftraining goalkeeper at the World Cup,
OL,12,Fwas named in the squad.
OL,14,FTuchel said there are some "major
OL,15,Fplayers" unavailable for England and,
OL,16,Fwith Ben White also out through
OL,17,Finjury, Alexander-Arnold has got this
OL,18,Fchance to impress.
