OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1790151501
OL,3,CCole Palmer and Trent Alexander-Arnold
OL,4,Creturn to the England squad
OL,6,F"It's an opportunity for Trent of
OL,7,Fcourse," the England boss told the
OL,8,FFootball Association.
OL,10,FAfter his time playing for Real
OL,11,FMadrid, Tuchel said: "He had a good
OL,12,Fstart to the season, I would say...
OL,13,Fit's a chance for him to claim what he
OL,14,Ffeels is yours, his place on the right
OL,15,Fside, so here we go.
OL,17,F"It's a long camp, four matches and
OL,18,Fwe're happy to have him back."
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@HO]sD@VOUyD@AOUzD@^O]
