PN,30406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1790151501
OL,3,CCole Palmer and Trent Alexander-Arnold
OL,4,Creturn to the England squad
OL,6,FTuchel said Palmer has been recalled
OL,7,Fafter getting "his numbers back" at
OL,8,FChelsea, while Ngumoha and Scott have
OL,9,Fbeen brought in after impressing
OL,10,Fduring the Florida training camp.
OL,12,F"Alex Scott has maybe one of the best
OL,13,Fperformances in midfield in the
OL,14,FPremier League since the start with
OL,15,FBournemouth," Tuchel said.
OL,16,F"Individually he's one of the
OL,17,Foutstanding midfielders so he clearly
OL,18,Fdeserves to be with us.
OL,26,@oD@OOUoD@`O]tD@AOUwD@MO]xD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1790151501
OL,3,CCole Palmer and Trent Alexander-Arnold
OL,4,Creturn to the England squad
OL,6,F"He took another step into the right
OL,7,Fdirection. Very impressive and happy
OL,8,Fthat he is on that route. Now he plays
OL,9,Fin Europe for Bournemouth and deserves
OL,10,Fto be with us."
OL,12,FAsked about Ngumoha, Tuchel said: "Rio
OL,13,Fwas very impressive at this kind of
OL,14,Fage. He was explosive, he was
OL,15,Fadventurous, he was strong and one-on-
OL,16,Fones like a true winger.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@cOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/8
