OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1790151501
OL,3,CCole Palmer and Trent Alexander-Arnold
OL,4,Creturn to the England squad
OL,6,F"This is an opportunity for him to
OL,7,Fshow that he can be a real
OL,8,Falternative. We are very excited about
OL,9,Fhis potential and about his natural
OL,10,Fcourage and adventurous style of play."
OL,12,FThe German manager said Josh King,
OL,13,Fanother training group player, was
OL,14,F"very, very close" and on his list
OL,15,Fafter he had a "good start with
OL,16,FFulham, scoring, assisting."
